  "answer": "I can't give you Auckland's unemployment rate. My labour force data covers Australia and its states and territories, not New Zealand. Stats NZ publishes the figure for Auckland in its quarterly Household Labour Force Survey.\n\nIf you meant an Australian city or state, here are the latest seasonally adjusted unemployment rates from the ABS for September 2026:\n\n- **Australia:** 4.7%\n- **New South Wales:** 4.7%\n- **Queensland:** 4.5%\n- **Victoria:** 5.1%\n\nNationally, the rate has risen from 4.3% in October 2025. If you tell me which Australian region you meant, I can pull its figures.",
